It's a bug, of course.  (I _think_ later patchlevels of 3.0 have the bug
fixed, but I'm not sure.)

>2. When a rust monster attacked me and I hit him (mentally writing off
>my weapon and armor) - the message was - 'you hit the rust monster
>the rust on your sword disappears' - what's going on here?

This means your sword is rustproof.  Reading enchant weapon/armor when
you're confused will rustproof the weapon/armor.  Also, Excalibur (when
gained from fountains or Hand of Elbereth) and Stormbringer (when gained
from the chaotic equivalent of hand of Elbereth) come rustproofed.
